        },
        {
          "text": "People of Philistia, the rod that beat you is broken, but you have no reason to be glad. When one snake dies, a worse one comes in its place. A snake's egg hatches a flying dragon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
