              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How shall we answer the messengers that come to us from Philistia? We will tell them that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has established Zion and that his suffering people will find safety there.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.32"
            ]
          }
